# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo root — Docker build context exclusions
#
# This file protects against anyone running `docker build .` from the repo
# root, or any future service whose build context is the entire monorepo.
# The currently active Dockerfiles use `./backend`, `./frontend`, and
# `./ML Model` as their build contexts (not the root), so this file does not
# affect today's builds. It is here as a safety net.
#
# Individual service `.dockerignore` files in backend/, frontend/, and
# ML Model/ handle the actual context filtering for current builds.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Version control ---
.git
.git/**
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Node ---
node_modules
**/node_modules
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store

# --- Python ---
.venv
**/.venv
venv
**/venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage

# --- Notebooks ---
*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.ipynb_checkpoints

# --- Secrets & local config ---
# Real .env files are NEVER sent to the daemon. .env.example is intentionally
# kept (per project policy) so it remains available for env_file references.
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- Tooling & IDE caches ---
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.eslintcache
.cache
.parcel-cache
.vite

# --- Claude / agent state ---
.claude
.claude/**
**/.claude
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE_CONTEXT.md
**/CLAUDE_CONTEXT.md

# --- Build outputs ---
dist
build
coverage
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage

# --- Docs (not needed at runtime in any container) ---
Documentation
docs
**/docs
**/Documentation

# --- Datasets & large data artefacts (not needed in any container) ---
# `dataset/` is bind-mounted by compose into db-init. It must NOT be COPY'd
# into any image. (The ML service uses its own copy of the CSV, which lives
# in ML Model/After_EDA_and_Feature_ENginering.csv, and is excluded by
# `ML Model/.dockerignore`'s patterns for the OTHER CSVs in that folder.)
dataset
**/dataset

# --- Semester / academic project folders (not part of the product) ---
semester
**/semester

# --- ML Model scratch dirs (defence-in-depth; ML Model/.dockerignore covers them too) ---
GSMArenaDataset
GSMArenaDataset_BATCH*
**/GSMArenaDataset_BATCH*
segmentation_outputs
**/segmentation_outputs
cells_dump*
preproc_cells.txt
**/Progress Fetch Data
**/web_scribing_to_fetch_data

# --- Uploads / logs / tmp ---
uploads
**/uploads
logs
**/logs
*.log
tmp
**/tmp
*.local
*.tmp

# --- Test artefacts ---
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
**/__tests__/**
**/__mocks__/**
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py
**/tests/**